if {bunnyOpen} and not {foxOpen}:
	Bunny: It feels nice to be seen.
	Bunny: Fox’s general goods store looks a little messy today…
	Bunny: I think he’s protective of it. He doesn’t open for just anyone, but he likes it when someone notices the place itself, not him.
	set {foxKey} = true
elif {gameEnd} == false:
	Bunny: Fresh carrots today! Just came in!
else:
	Bunny: I love seeing everyone so happy. You did good!
if {squirrelKey} == true and {squirrelKey3}  ==  false:
	- Squirrel was wondering what time would be best for opening his library.
		Bunny: Personally I usually like a good book after a nice meal!
		set {squirrelKey3} = true
	- Later!
if {skunkKey} == true and {skunkKey3} == false:
	- What do you think of Skunk's coffee?
		Bunny: Skunk’s coffee helps me steady myself before I start the day. I always stop by when I need a moment.
		set {skunkKey3} = true
	- Later!
if {bearOpen} == true and {bearBunny} == false:
	- Here you go, Bunny! A little treat for all your hard work.
		Bunny: Oh! This is just what I needed… thank you!
		set {bearBunny} = true
	- Later!
[signal arg="dialogue_end"]